# Puca's Eye ({2}): "When this artifact enters, draw a card, then choose a color. This artifact becomes the chosen color." and
# "{3}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if there are five colors among permanents you control." Omnath, Locus of Creation is
# red, green, white and blue (four colors). On turn 3 Bot1 casts the Eye (colorless, so still four colors) and, with {G}{W}{U}
# in the pool to pay {3}, is refused the draw while the trigger waits; the trigger draws a card, Bot1 names black, and the Eye
# is black (CR 105.2, 613.1e): five colors, so the same ability now draws a second card and taps the Eye.

